63
00:06:49,237 --> 00:06:56,660
of our customer trying to assess
the refund policy by using an agent.

64
00:06:57,595 --> 00:07:00,403
Let's start with that
ordinary-looking document.

65
00:07:00,436 --> 00:07:01,924
