81
00:08:26,861 --> 00:08:32,120
Because even if the model is
fooled, the next question is:

82
00:08:32,603 --> 00:08:34,746
Whose authority does it have?

83
00:08:35,737 --> 00:08:37,767
What identity does it run on?

84
00:08:38,767 --> 00:08:41,870
There are different ways an
agent can access your system,

85
00:08:42,881 --> 00:08:44,607
