192
00:17:44,805 --> 00:17:49,427
Our customer data export might
actually take, a different

193
00:17:49,445 --> 00:17:52,459
route to an enterprise API.

194
00:17:52,683 --> 00:17:54,437
So this is it.

195
00:17:54,714 --> 00:17:58,499
It takes-- Imagine if it takes a
different route to an enterprise API.

196
00:17:59,534 --> 00:18:03,532
That action still needs its
own authorization check.

197
00:18:05,131 --> 00:18:09,823
And when a control blocks something,
how do we know what happened?

198
00:18:10,823 --> 00:18:13,175
Can you trace, trace these activities?

199
00:18:13,919 --> 00:18:18,779
Can you measure it or can you even
