207
00:18:45,369 --> 00:18:47,302
Then the agent responds.

208
00:18:47,965 --> 00:18:52,834
The customer might see an ordinary
response, but the engineering and

209
00:18:52,843 --> 00:18:58,228
security team should be able to see
the attempted export, the malicious

210
00:18:58,247 --> 00:19:03,239
activities, and the malicious
