213
00:19:14,955 --> 00:19:16,909
Who owns this agent?

214
00:19:17,595 --> 00:19:19,586
Can we revoke his access?

215
00:19:20,224 --> 00:19:22,192
Can we disable his tools?

216
00:19:23,417 --> 00:19:29,534
And also, can we check logs
