00:21:04,805 --> 00:21:06,763
I call it the least agency.

236
00:21:07,295 --> 00:21:11,956
Give an agent enough freedom to
do the job, but not more, no more.

237
00:21:12,345 --> 00:21:17,259
So it would have enough freedom to
do its job, scope the access to its

238
00:21:17,270 --> 00:21:24,380
use case, offer narrow access to
tools, so, and order within limits.

239
00:21:24,973 --> 00:21:31,455
Deny unapproved actions by default
and put humans in the loop for high

240
00:21:31,484 --> 00:21:35,876
impact activities or activities
that require irreversible changes.

241
00:21:36,969 --> 00:21:41,791
And let the model propose a plan
while the deterministic application

